    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>The idea is ours. The company could be yours.<br />We bring a validated startup idea. You take it from zero to one. The best builder becomes its founder, backed by Persist from day one.</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Join the WhatsApp Group for Updates &amp; Communication: </strong><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/BFG7SMRKd4ZCyZ0zOzQKZP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/BFG7SMRKd4ZCyZ0zOzQKZP</a></p>\n<p><strong><br />What the winner gets</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>10% equity in a Persist-backed startup</li>\n<li>Monthly stipend as your runway while you build</li>\n<li>$250 cash prize</li>\n<li>A full startup stack: Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, AWS and Google Cloud credits</li>\n<li>Direct access to the Persist founder team for mentorship, feedback and go-to-market support</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The opportunity</strong></p>\n<p>A big, unsolved gap in the creator economy, with millions of potential users and no clear winner yet. Your mission is to build the AI-powered product that cracks it: ship an MVP, put it in front of real users, and show early traction.<br />The full brief, founder walkthrough video and resources unlock after you register on the Startupathon website.</p>\n<p><strong>Who should build</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Students, graduates and working professionals, from anywhere</li>\n<li>Solo participation only. This is a founder audition, so teams aren't allowed.</li>\n<li>Ideal for full-stack and AI builders with a founder mindset</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How it works</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1: Register here on Unstop</li>\n<li>Step 2: Unlock the full brief at startupathon.persist.org</li>\n<li>Step 3: Ship your MVP. You get 4 iterations, with reviewer feedback after each, just like a real build cycle.</li>\n<li>Step 4: Top builders are reviewed, and the winner gets the founding offer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Registrations close</strong>: Sat, Fri, Oct 30, 11:59 PM IST</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE</strong></p>\n<p>The earlier you register, the more time you'll have to build and improve your MVP before submissions close.</p>",
